# Line-ending policy: everything text is LF.
# Rationale: the tree is mostly shell + Go. core.autocrlf=true clients used
# to hand back CRLF working copies on checkout — bash then errors on every
# function definition ("unexpected token `$'{\r'"). Pin LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact artifacts (should they ever exist): keep as-is.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.qcow2 binary
*.gz binary
